    {
      "text": "FDA's most recent inspection of that plant ended on 2026-05-20 and was classified VAI.",
      "cites": ["E10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A separate manufacturer, Salix Pharmaceuticals, a division of Bausch Health US, LLC, has a different formulation posted as To Be Discontinued on 2026-08-13.",
      "cites": ["E12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale Lakeside holds 15 units with 8.9 days on hand at current use.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 271 units with 27.7 days on hand and can spare 9 units while retaining at least two weeks of supply.",
      "cites": ["D2", "D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The recommended action is to transfer 9 units from Corvale General to Corvale Lakeside, which would bring Lakeside to 14 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    }
  ]
